- elementId: ev-badge-text
  elementType: text
  bounds: [1080, 30, 140, 22]
  content:
    fontSize: 12
    color: #FFFFFF
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.0
    align: [center, middle]
    wrap: False
    text: |
      E1 / Peer-reviewed
- elementId: body
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 90, 1160, 560]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      <p><strong>核心论点：</strong>提出面向 TEE 的 scalable I/O protection，聚焦设备 access control 和 metadata/checking 可扩展性。</p>
      <p>sIOPMP 是 RISC-V trusted I/O 和 DMA 保护的 peer-reviewed 机制起点。</p>
      <p>该论文发表于 ASPLOS，提供可扩展的 I/O 保护元数据与检查机制，提高设备访问控制效率并支撑更大规模 I/O protection。</p>
- elementId: source
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 690, 1160, 20]
  content:
    fontSize: 14
    color: $secondary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.2
    wrap: True
    text: |
      来源：sIOPMP: scalable I/O protection for TEE｜证据等级：E1 / Peer-reviewed SOTA
- elementId: bottom-bar
